title: We're All Connected By Cycling Carbon
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Oh! Everything that is CO2 related? Building materials and otherwise

Me
You
A glacier
A tree
A rain cloud
A crustacean
A prairie
A bison
A building
A plastic bottle
A dinosaur
A blanket
A war
A museum
A virus
A hamburger
An orgasm
An iPhone
An ideology

As passengers here
on [[Spaceship Earth]]
Everything is the same,
even if it is different.
We're all connected
By cycling carbon.
